    "preamble": "Sabeena Banu vs / on 26 September, 2025 Author: Anita Sumanth Bench: Anita Sumanth Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 26.09.2025 Coram: The Honourable Dr.Justice Anita Sumanth And The Honourable Mr.Justice C.Kumarappan W.P.(MD)No.26357 of 2025 and W.M.P.(MD)No.20496 of 2025 Sabeena Banu . /Vs./ 1. The District Collector, Collectorate Office Campus, Madurai. 2. The Commissioner of Police, Commissionerate, Madurai District, Madurai. 3. The Municipality Commissioner, Municipal Corporation Office, Madurai District. 4. The Deputy Director, Tamil Nadu Fire and Rescue Service Department, Madurai South Zone, Madurai District. 1/7 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
